  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Speakers Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Speakers Program: This funding will support the engagement of recognized experts in a variety of policy-relevant fields for in-country consultations, lectures, seminars, training sessions, and workshops. These experts pass along practical skills, thereby creating a multiplier effect within the host country. The Speakers Program aims to provide a wide range of perspectives, promotes the recognition of fundamental liberties and individual freedoms, and increases civic participation.</narrative>
  </description>
